# MegaFlash Apple-bus bring-up for MAME bridge (-a2bus-bridge).
# PHI0 so IsAppleConnected(). BusLoop core1 is launched by a2bus hooks after
# cyw43_arch_init returns (and .data is restored — gSPI can clobber BusLoop RAM).
# Wall-time driven under a2bus (see main.c script_poll).

10ms: gpio20 1
10ms: gpio19 0
50ms: a2phi
